        "description": "Defines the size of the flag, aligned with the typographic scale used by components such as p-icon, p-spinner, p-text, and p-heading. When set to \`inherit\`, the size is derived from a custom font-size defined on a parent element, calculated against the global line-height (based on \`ex\`-unit) to remain visually consistent with other typographic-scale-based components.",
